WEBVTT

58:02.547 --> 58:04.132
A loyal friend.

58:04.257 --> 58:05.925
The last one I've got.

58:07.677 --> 58:09.846
- I hope I'll serve you well.
- You will.

58:11.139 --> 58:14.350
And I'll make sure you don't look
so fucking grim all the time.

58:15.685 --> 58:17.937
Come on, boys,
let's go kill some boar!

58:28.156 --> 58:29.657
Come on, you.
